   "source": [
    "## Estimating pos, lin vel and ang vel\n",
    "\n",
    "Using leg odometry to create a measurement for lin vel and IMU for ang vel. If no value for base acc is provided, its estimated with the following equation:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\ddot{q}_B = H_B^{-1} \\cdot (J^TF - H_{BL}\\ddot{q}_L -c-g)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "If not value for contact force is provided, its estimated with the following equation:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "F = J \\cdot \\tau\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "The Kalman Filter matrices for $A$, $B$ and $H$ are:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "A = \\begin{bmatrix} I_3 & dt\\cdot I_3 & 0\\\\\n",
    "0 & I_3 & 0\\\\\n",
    "0 & 0 & I_3\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "B = \\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "0 & 0 \\\\\n",
    "dt\\cdot I_3 & 0\\\\\n",
    "0 & dt\\cdot I_3\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "H = \\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "0 & dt\\cdot I_3 & 0 \\\\\n",
    "0 & 0 & dt\\cdot I_3\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
